('acchon-gpa', 'sp-accounting-honors', 2, 'Honors GPA standard', 'manual', null, null, null, null, '{}'::text[], 'A 3.5 cumulative GPA overall and a 3.5 GPA in all Accounting & MIS courses, plus 60 graded semester hours in residence on the Columbus campus, to graduate with Honors in Accounting.', null),
