('finhon-rest', 'sp-finance-honors', 1, 'Rest of the 9-course curriculum, seminars & senior paper', 'manual', null, null, null, null, '{}'::text[], 'Nine courses in the Finance Honors curriculum in all, including an honors seminar each semester (for example BUSFIN 4630H, Finance Honors Seminar-Capstone), at least two more honors or 4000-level courses, and a senior paper approved by the Finance Honors faculty director. Fisher''s curriculum sheet names the rest; confirm with your honors advisor.', null),
